{
  "uid": "myyoutube-business-identity",
  "title": "MyYoutube 注册与登录",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "MyYoutube",
    "业务"
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "业务总览",
      "url": "/d/myyoutube-business-overview",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "各链路看板",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "业务"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "内容单笔事件",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:15601/app/dashboards#/view/myyoutube-business-flow",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "上传准备单笔事件",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:15601/app/dashboards#/view/myyoutube-upload-flow",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "实例",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"myyoutube-java\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "口径与排障入口",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "注册、登录、凭证续签、登出、重置密码。成功表示服务方法正常返回，不代表用户索引已同步。\n\n统计单位为操作调用/尝试，包含重试和幂等重放，不是去重用户数、内容数或端到端成功率。无流量、未接入、采样失败或过期显示无数据，不补零。\n\nsuccess=正常返回；empty=返回空列表/空页；no_change=条件未命中；business_error=BizException（含业务校验，也可能包装基础设施故障）；failure=其他异常或事务回滚。"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "业务操作接入状态",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "1 表示此实例已登记业务埋点；同时检查服务抓取状态。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "myyoutube_business_operation_enabled{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "各操作完成速率及结果",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "统计单位为操作调用/尝试，包含重试和幂等重放，不是去重用户数、内容数或端到端成功率。无流量、未接入、采样失败或过期显示无数据，不补零。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (rate(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "所选时段调用完成量",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "按计数器增量统计，自动处理进程重启；窗口开始前需要有抓取样本。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "正常返回比例（含空结果和条件未命中）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "无调用时没有有效比例；不是整条链路成功率。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\",outcome=~\"success|empty|no_change\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by(operation) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "操作耗时 P95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "同步方法调用至事务最终完成；不包含后续异步业务耗时。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le,operation) (rate(myyoutube_business_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "当前在途调用",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "包含等待外层事务完成的操作。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation) (myyoutube_business_inflight{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "业务异常与系统异常",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "success=正常返回；empty=返回空列表/空页；no_change=条件未命中；business_error=BizException（含业务校验，也可能包装基础设施故障）；failure=其他异常或事务回滚。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未观测 / 无样本"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "myyoutube-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(operation,outcome) (increase(myyoutube_business_operations_total{job=\"myyoutube-java\",instance=~\"$instance\",chain=\"identity\",outcome=~\"business_error|failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    }
  ]
}
